---
import PermissionDiagram from './PermissionDiagram.astro';
---
<section class="access-section editorial-section" aria-labelledby="access-title">
  <div class="editorial-intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">Non-custodial operation</p>
    <h2 id="access-title">Your assets.<br/>Defined permissions.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="access-explanation">
    <p>You retain control of your assets. We agree the access needed to operate, with the setup adapted to your requirements.</p>
    <p class="access-boundary-note">For DEX management, our roles are restricted to the specified pool and pair, without withdrawal or send authority. We agree ranges, balances and operating limits with you before operation.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="permission-map"><PermissionDiagram /></div>
</section>
<style>
  .access-section { row-gap: 32px; }
  .access-explanation { padding-top: 28px; }
  .access-boundary-note { color: var(--muted); }
  .permission-map { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-width: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .access-explanation { padding-top: 0; } }
</style>
